1. DESIGN-LANGUAGE REFERENCE MATERIAL
===========================================================================

The theme presets under crates/teksilo-theme-* reproduce the look of design
languages published by other vendors. What each preset took, and on what
terms, differs; each is stated separately below. No vendor logo, icon set,
artwork, or proprietary font is included in any of them.


1.1  WinUI / Fluent  --  crates/teksilo-theme-fluent
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The colour values in crates/teksilo-theme-fluent/src/palette.rs are
transcribed from the WinUI theme-resource dictionaries
